  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "横版跳跃与攀爬是骨架，大量武器战斗则提供2D射击体验",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "REMAINS is a mix of genres with its core as a platformer: side view, familiar game mechanics (jumping, climbing stairs). A rich arsenal of weapons plus fights being a crucial part of the game give you vibes of 2D-shooter.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3908900/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "程序生成区域中同时进行开锁、搜刮、升级、技能、制作与交易",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Finally, you can take it as a roguelike game with exploring procedurally generated locations, picking locks, gathering loot, leveling up and learning new skills/perks, crafting, trading, etc.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3908900/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "近百种敌人、约两百种武器爆炸物、数十法术与六十余天赋构成大体量搭配池",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The amount of content right now is huge: several large locations with numerous kinds of rooms, almost a hundred types of enemies, about two hundred types of weapons and explosives, dozens of spells, more than sixty perks and plenty of other things.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3908900/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
